LA PLANCHADA (shadow puppetry): third-party assets

Picture: drawn entirely in code (Canvas 2D hide-puppet compositor); no stock footage, no generated images or video. The legend is traditional folklore (see FACTS.md); the puppets are original.
Font (SIL OFL 1.1, Google Fonts): Cormorant Garamond.
Voice: Kokoro-82M TTS via kokoro-onnx (voice bm_george), Apache-2.0. Speech check: faster-whisper (MIT).
Music: original, played from sampled instruments:
- Samples (CC0): Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
Foley (flaps, hiss, thuds, plucks): synthesised in mix.py.
